WEBVTT

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:06.250
What the hell? He shrunk!?

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:07.350
What's going on?

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:09.260
He...

00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:12.440
He totally screwed up his weight management.

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:15.870
Dark clouds gather over Korakuen Hall!

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:18.020
But there will be no delays!

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:20.370
The bell for this climactic battle has now...

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:24.380
been sounded!

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:40.640
<i>The bell was rung and I still can't gather any strength.</i>

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:41.600
<i>What am I gonna do?</i>

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:43.200
Takamura-san...

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.600
Takamura-san!

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:47.100
<i>What are you going to do, Takamura-san?</i>

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.610
Whoa, Takamura makes the first move!

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:52.610
He makes a straight line for the other end of the ring!

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:55.610
He's fast!

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:03.410
It's a sudden rush!

00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:07.120
He's swinging like he's trying to blow those dark clouds away!

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:08.820
West is forced on the defensive!

00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:10.630
He can't fight back!

00:01:10.630 --> 00:01:12.160
So he was okay after all!?

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:13.630
That's one hell of an attack!

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:16.660
<i>Can a boxer who screwed up his weight management be this fast?</i>

00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:17.630
<i>Unbelievable!</i>

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:19.890
<i>That's a tight block.</i>

00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:20.880
<i>A left!</i>

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:24.070
<i>It's a right, fool!</i>

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:26.250
A right after a feint!

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:27.650
It lands cleanly!

00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:28.600
Did he get him!?

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:29.980
That was amazing!

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:31.570
All right, he got him!

00:01:31.570 --> 00:01:33.300
No way he can stand after that!

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:34.480
That's more like it!

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:34.980
Huh?

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:41.530
Shockingly, West doesn't seem bothered by it!

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:44.990
He doesn't react at all after taking a right from Takamura!

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:47.000
<i>Pretty tough, ain't you?</i>

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:48.370
Left!

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:51.460
Right!

00:01:54.310 --> 00:01:56.020
He's landing great shots, but...

00:01:56.020 --> 00:01:58.220
That guy has to be monstrously tough!

00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:00.770
No... That's not it.

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:03.720
Takamura's punches are light!

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:11.190
<i>Are these really the punches of a guy who's undefeated with 14 consecutive KO's?</i>

00:02:11.890 --> 00:02:13.780
<i>They're way too light.</i>

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:17.300
<i>They're like the punches of someone from two or three weight classes down.</i>

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:24.670
Whoa, and Takamura backs off!

00:02:24.670 --> 00:02:29.000
<i>I was hoping to bluff by going on the offensive, but he's already figured out that there's no strength in my punches!</i>

00:02:29.930 --> 00:02:32.250
<i>I can't last for too many rounds,</i>

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:34.920
<i>so I need to wrap this up as quickly as possible.</i>

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:36.000
<i>Which means...</i>

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:43.010
And now Takamura is gesturing for him to bring it on at the center of the ring.

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:45.700
Will West be provoked?

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:48.020
Will he step up and slug it out?

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:50.010
<i>Come on, come on...</i>

00:02:51.800 --> 00:02:53.020
<i>Come on, come on!</i>

00:02:57.770 --> 00:02:58.520
He...

00:02:58.520 --> 00:02:59.710
He doesn't!

00:02:59.710 --> 00:03:01.230
He doesn't go for it!

00:03:01.230 --> 00:03:03.530
West doesn't make a move!

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:05.970
<i>I'm not gonna fall for that.</i>

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:07.200
<i>I get it.</i>

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.160
<i>You don't have enough strength to do the job,</i>

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:12.160
<i>so you need to use mine, right?</i>

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:13.410
Crap!

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:15.030
This West guy is clever!

00:03:15.030 --> 00:03:16.920
He's seen through Takamura-san's plan!

00:03:17.270 --> 00:03:21.920
He was trying to lure him in for a counter instead of wasting energy with punches that won't do any good.

00:03:25.690 --> 00:03:29.190
<i>So you think as long as you don't get hit with a counter, that I can't beat you?</i>

00:03:29.190 --> 00:03:31.680
<i>You're not afraid of my punches?</i>

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:36.200
<i>Don't screw with me!</i>

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:38.060
Takamura makes his move!

00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:39.940
It's a vicious offensive!

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:41.550
Don't get pissed off!

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:42.780
Calm down!

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:44.780
<i>The world title's almost in my grasp!</i>

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:47.780
<i>I'm not gonna give it up for you!</i>

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:49.780
<i>Quit running, dammit!</i>

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:58.500
And there's the bell!

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:00.170
The first round is over!

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:03.800
Takamura has the point lead because of his persistent offense.

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:08.930
However, he seems to have paid a grave price in exchange for that!

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:12.520
Just look at how exhausted he is!

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:15.680
Will Takamura Mamoru make it!?

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:18.860
W-Water...

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:19.690
Don't swallow it,

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:21.270
just gargle.

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:26.070
I just told you not to swallow!

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:29.070
Dammit, if you get nailed there now...

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:32.200
the pain from having swallowed the water will be excruciating!

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:34.770
Shut up already! Stop worrying!

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:36.830
I'll wipe him out in the next round!

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:41.090
Now he's arguing with his second.

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:42.980
He's going to self-destruct.

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:47.240
Just stay cautious and keep this up.

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:49.660
I'm really lucky.

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:53.820
I never thought I'd be able to get a world ranking against someone as easy to deal with as this.

00:04:53.820 --> 00:04:55.350
Seconds out!

00:04:56.180 --> 00:04:58.340
Round 2!

00:05:01.620 --> 00:05:02.520
Takamura-san...

00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:03.860
Please calm down!

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:06.490
Whoa!

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:08.450
Takamura takes the initiative!

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:09.610
West is on the evasive!

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:12.370
<i>Stop running away, dammit!</i>

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:16.370
<i>I'm gonna teach you what happens when someone screws with me!</i>

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:19.620
Not good, he didn't calm down at all during the interval!

00:05:19.620 --> 00:05:21.640
I-If he doesn't calm down...

00:05:21.640 --> 00:05:25.020
Dumbass, it's Takamura-san fighting out there!

00:05:25.020 --> 00:05:27.510
He'll come up with something.

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:30.020
<i>Takamura-san...</i>

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:26.450
West is showing footwork fit for a bullfighter and Takamura continues to come up empty!

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:32.060
West's outboxing doesn't display the explosive impacts that are usually present in the higher weight classes.

00:06:32.610 --> 00:06:34.030
But...

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:35.580
But!

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:38.520
The effect is clear!

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:42.580
In the sixth round, Takamura has finally stalled!

00:06:42.850 --> 00:06:44.270
What are you doing, dumbass!?

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:46.340
Don't fall for an obvious plan like that!

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:48.090
Think a little!

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:50.910
You're not a wild boar, so stop charging around like one!

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:53.050
Use your head a little, dammit!

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:53.990
<i>Shut it.</i>

00:06:53.990 --> 00:06:56.100
<i>I know damn well what he's up to!</i>

00:06:56.980 --> 00:07:02.100
<i>But being able to crush petty tactics like this head on is what makes a man great!</i>

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:04.410
<i>Yes!</i>

00:07:05.430 --> 00:07:07.010
<i>I want to be like...</i>

00:07:07.010 --> 00:07:09.940
<i>the guy who managed to hit more homeruns than anyone could have ever imagined!</i>

00:07:09.940 --> 00:07:12.950
<i>Like, Oh Sadaharu!</i>

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:14.110
<i>But!</i>

00:07:15.140 --> 00:07:16.610
<i>It's no good.</i>

00:07:16.610 --> 00:07:20.450
<i>It's pathetic, but my body's weakened more than I thought it would.</i>

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:24.140
<i>I've never felt this tired before.</i>

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:27.140
A left from West!

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:29.080
He's not throwing just to connect anymore!

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:32.630
It's the first destructive punch thrown in this match!

00:07:33.070 --> 00:07:35.730
He knows Takamura-san's out of gas now!

00:07:35.730 --> 00:07:38.140
He's switching to offense!

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:45.690
A one-two lands!

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:47.140
He pushes forward!

00:07:47.140 --> 00:07:50.360
West is showing aggression completely absent from the prior rounds!

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:52.540
<i>Dammit...</i>

00:07:52.540 --> 00:07:53.580
<i>I can see them...</i>

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:55.100
<i>I can see them, but...</i>

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:56.990
<i>I'm still getting hit!</i>

00:07:57.340 --> 00:07:58.730
<i>My body won't listen!</i>

00:07:58.730 --> 00:08:00.990
<i>How can a loser like him do this to me?</i>

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:04.460
Whoa, Takamura is a punching bag against the ropes!

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:06.660
It's an unbelievable sight!

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:08.270
The entire arena has been silenced!

00:08:08.270 --> 00:08:14.010
Will Japan's Hawk, who intended to fly to the top of the world, be smashed into the ground!?

00:08:08.270 --> 00:08:14.010
Note: Taka in Japanese means hawk.

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:14.980
<i>Oh, hell...</i>

00:08:14.980 --> 00:08:17.270
<i>after what happened at the beach and now this.</i>

00:08:17.270 --> 00:08:18.510
<i>Is this part of that curse too?</i>

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:21.010
What are you doing!? Fight back!

00:08:21.010 --> 00:08:22.640
<i>Dammit!</i>

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:25.520
<i>I have my hands full with just blocking right now!</i>

00:08:31.020 --> 00:08:32.800
Shoot, his guard is down!

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:33.780
He's gonna get nailed!

00:08:34.130 --> 00:08:36.790
<i>Thanks for the world ranking!</i>

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:40.780
<i>I'll beat the world champ in your place, so rest in peace!</i>

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:47.750
<i>I was waiting for this!</i>

00:08:51.730 --> 00:08:53.900
Whoa, a counter!

00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:56.050
Was this Takamura's aim all along!?

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:56.870
Yes!

00:08:56.870 --> 00:08:57.790
He got him!

00:08:57.790 --> 00:08:59.590
I knew he could do it!

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:05.980
But it seems the one on shaky ground after that exchange is Takamura!

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:08.940
The mighty Takamura has been totally outdone!

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:11.440
I-It can't be...

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:14.940
<i>I've seen Takamura-san in trouble before,</i>

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:17.630
<i>but I always believed that he'd be okay.</i>

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:21.520
<i>That he'd pull it off in the end!</i>

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:24.060
<i>This is the first time...</i>

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:26.930
<i>I have a really bad feeling!</i>

00:09:27.950 --> 00:09:29.460
<i>Don't scare me like that.</i>

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:30.960
<i>This time, you're done for!</i>

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:33.750
Takamura-san!

00:09:35.240 --> 00:09:36.670
A clinch!

00:09:36.670 --> 00:09:38.720
Takamura grabs on to survive!

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:40.120
That Takamura...

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:41.390
...clinched!?

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:42.720
I've never seen anything like it.

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:44.820
<i>That one really got me.</i>

00:09:44.820 --> 00:09:47.330
<i>If I didn't grab onto him, I wouldn't be able to hang on.</i>

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:49.270
<i>How much time is left?</i>

00:09:50.410 --> 00:09:52.230
<i>One minute and thirty seconds!?</i>

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:53.400
Takamura, let go!

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:53.400
<i>You've gotta be kidding.</i>

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:56.230
<i>Are you trying to piss me off, scoreboвЂ”</i>

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:56.230
Takamura!

00:09:57.250 --> 00:09:58.290
<i>What!?</i>

00:09:58.790 --> 00:09:59.800
Break it up, Takamura!

00:09:59.800 --> 00:10:00.780
Takamura-kun,

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:01.830
let him go!

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:03.370
You're going to get penalized!

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:04.370
What's he...

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:05.880
Takamura!

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:09.280
What's Takamura-san looking at?

00:10:09.280 --> 00:10:11.320
He's staring out into the crowd.

00:10:11.320 --> 00:10:13.700
The west section at ringside...

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:16.130
But the only thing that stands out there is a foreigner.

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:19.630
That's...

00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:20.200
Hey...

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:21.130
Isn't that man...

00:10:22.170 --> 00:10:23.140
<i>There's no doubt about it!</i>

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:28.450
<i>The WBC World Jr. Middleweight Champion!</i>

00:10:29.010 --> 00:10:30.710
<i>Bryan Hawk!</i>

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:36.090
<i>What the hell is he doing here?</i>

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:46.810
<i>Why?</i>

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:49.850
Takamura, break it up!

00:10:49.850 --> 00:10:52.490
<i>What the hell is he doing here?</i>

00:10:53.260 --> 00:10:54.210
Takamura!

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:56.700
Break it up!

00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:02.720
Box!

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:07.970
<i>What the hell are you staring at!?</i>

00:11:07.970 --> 00:11:10.600
Takamura, eyes in front!

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:16.020
He's caught against the ropes!

00:11:16.270 --> 00:11:17.870
West is on the assault!

00:11:17.870 --> 00:11:18.880
<i>Dammit,</i>

00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:21.360
<i>attacking someone when their attention is somewhere else!</i>

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:23.110
<i>You coward!</i>

00:11:23.110 --> 00:11:25.450
<i>Takamura doesn't have any strength left!</i>

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:29.080
<i>If I won out in a dual exchange, then I don't even need to worry about counters!</i>

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:31.620
<i>I'll put him down and then go for the world title!</i>

00:11:33.660 --> 00:11:35.680
Takamura's in a pinch!

00:11:35.680 --> 00:11:38.630
A world title challenge is within his grasp, but will he let it slip through his fingers!?

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:40.660
Get it together, Takamura!

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:42.840
Don't drop the ball after coming all this way!

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:44.700
Takamura-san, hang on!

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:46.330
Get away from the ropes!

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:49.220
<i>These annoying punches are coming so fast that I can't move...</i>

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:53.620
<i>But why is he in Japan?</i>

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:55.850
<i>Spying on me?</i>

00:11:56.160 --> 00:11:58.270
<i>How cute of him,</i>

00:11:58.270 --> 00:11:58.860
<i>but...</i>

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:01.860
<i>What's with his attitude?</i>

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:05.070
<i>A girl on each arm?</i>

00:12:05.070 --> 00:12:07.310
<i>He's not taking this very seriously.</i>

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:10.700
<i>And he's grinning like a fool...</i>

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:12.370
<i>Does he enjoy seeing me struggle?</i>

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:17.130
<i>It's pissing... me off!</i>

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:20.630
A clean hit!

00:12:22.070 --> 00:12:23.630
Did that get him!?

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:24.900
Takamura-san!

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:26.010
Takamura-kun!

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:26.010
Takamura!

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:27.360
The world title is waiting!

00:12:27.360 --> 00:12:28.510
Finish him, West!

00:12:28.950 --> 00:12:30.510
<i>I've got him!</i>

00:12:33.590 --> 00:12:35.520
<i>What is it, dammit?</i>

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:41.030
<i>Smiling like that...</i>

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:43.720
<i>It's pissing me off.</i>

00:12:46.150 --> 00:12:50.960
<i>And now you're smirking too?</i>

00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:52.530
<i>It's pissing me off...</i>

00:12:53.740 --> 00:12:56.160
<i>It's really pissing me off!</i>

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:03.170
<i>Don't think that you're gonna win!</i>

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:09.600
Another dual exchange!

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:12.010
A counter thrown from the brink of desperation!

00:13:12.010 --> 00:13:13.410
Dual exchanges won't cut it!

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:14.780
You'll end up worse off!

00:13:14.780 --> 00:13:15.890
No, look!

00:13:18.390 --> 00:13:20.190
He's staggering too!

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:20.900
It's working!

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:22.840
<i>I made it this close to the world title...</i>

00:13:22.840 --> 00:13:24.900
<i>I won't back off now!</i>

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:28.860
<i>Everyone's pissing me off!</i>

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:33.430
<i>He still has this much strength left?</i>

00:13:33.430 --> 00:13:35.580
<i>But this should be the last of it.</i>

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:40.100
<i>Who do you think I am!?</i>

00:13:40.100 --> 00:13:42.090
Another dual exchange!?

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:44.370
You're freaking me out, Takamura!

00:13:44.370 --> 00:13:46.590
Please, be more careful!

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:49.080
West, you can do it! This is what it all comes down to!

00:13:50.050 --> 00:13:51.700
An exchange of punches!

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:54.100
A storm of punches! It's an exchange of heavy duty counters!

00:13:56.180 --> 00:13:57.850
Both fighters' heads are sent flying backwards!

00:13:57.850 --> 00:14:01.100
A devastating exchange in the center of the ring!

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:03.610
W-Wait, center of the ring?

00:14:03.990 --> 00:14:06.110
Wasn't Takamura just against the ropes?

00:14:06.560 --> 00:14:07.490
He...

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:08.610
He's winning out!

00:14:24.650 --> 00:14:26.130
<i>I am...</i>

00:14:27.660 --> 00:14:30.880
<i>Takamura Mamoru-sama, dammit!</i>

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:33.920
Whoa,

00:14:33.920 --> 00:14:36.120
now West is against the ropes!

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:40.810
This series of dual exchanges has carried all the way to the other side of the ring!

00:14:45.800 --> 00:14:48.340
<i>Take a good look!</i>

00:14:48.340 --> 00:14:51.320
<i>I'm the one who's going after the world title!</i>

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:19.340
H-He's knocked out of the ring!

00:15:19.340 --> 00:15:20.870
The referee steps in!

00:15:20.870 --> 00:15:23.190
The match is over!

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:25.370
What a destructive KO!

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:27.740
What an explosive finale!

00:15:27.740 --> 00:15:29.360
The winner is Takamura!

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:32.770
He succeeds and advances to the world title in extravagant fashion!

00:15:32.770 --> 00:15:34.670
Hey, he's not raising his hand...

00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:38.800
That's not like him.

00:15:38.800 --> 00:15:39.760
What's he staring at?

00:15:42.220 --> 00:15:43.740
Hey, isn't that...

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:45.250
Yeah, that's him!

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:48.170
The WBC World Jr. Middleweight Champion!

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:49.640
That's Bryan Hawk!

00:15:49.640 --> 00:15:51.280
The guy Takamura is fighting next!

00:15:51.280 --> 00:15:52.730
He came to spy on him!

00:15:52.730 --> 00:15:54.420
He's huge!

00:15:54.420 --> 00:15:56.200
The crowd figured it out.

00:15:56.200 --> 00:15:58.960
I guess the audience recognizes who he is.

00:15:58.960 --> 00:16:00.260
T-They're giving him a mic!

00:16:00.260 --> 00:16:01.320
Takamura!

00:16:01.320 --> 00:16:03.520
Say something awesome like you usually do!

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:07.400
Excuse me, but the fans are really excited, so if we could just get a word...

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:10.770
I've got nothing to say to someone who forgot to bring their luggage.

00:16:10.770 --> 00:16:12.900
I'll talk to him after he goes home and gets it.

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:14.780
Luggage?

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:16.910
I'm talking about this.

00:16:17.630 --> 00:16:21.090
If he doesn't have the belt with him, I've got nothing to say to him.

00:16:21.850 --> 00:16:23.540
Now that was smooth!

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:24.740
So cool!

00:16:24.740 --> 00:16:26.040
I'm looking forward to it!

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:28.250
December is going to be awesome!

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:31.080
Be sure to take the title, Takamura!

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:34.090
He's going back without much of a fuss.

00:16:34.090 --> 00:16:35.550
He must really be tired.

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:37.550
But it's a relief!

00:16:37.550 --> 00:16:42.430
Usually when he opens his mouth, he just gets himself into trouble.

00:16:44.910 --> 00:16:47.480
Any comments on your victory? It was obvious you weren't in the best of condition.

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:49.230
Did you get a good feel of the world stage?

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:51.430
Any impressions of the world champion after seeing him in person?

00:16:52.410 --> 00:16:54.070
Come on now, don't ask all at once.

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:55.440
One at a time!

00:16:55.440 --> 00:16:58.470
I hate to admit it, but he's really impressive.

00:16:58.470 --> 00:17:00.970
Yeah, considering he won in the state he was in.

00:17:00.970 --> 00:17:02.350
It was amazing!

00:17:02.350 --> 00:17:06.130
He was in bad shape too, but after taking all those punches, he had to be hurting.

00:17:06.650 --> 00:17:09.910
And he was able to accurately land all those counters!

00:17:09.910 --> 00:17:12.370
His technique and strength were both incredible!

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:15.120
It's all because of his spirit.

00:17:15.120 --> 00:17:18.380
You could see how the look on his face changed when he saw the champion.

00:17:18.620 --> 00:17:23.180
It just means that he snapped when he saw the champion with those chicks, not taking the match seriously.

00:17:23.530 --> 00:17:25.830
We've known him for a long time,

00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:27.690
but I've never seen him snap like that before.

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:29.010
It gave me the chills.

00:17:29.010 --> 00:17:32.490
I've never wanted to avoid pissing him off as much as I do right now.

00:17:32.490 --> 00:17:35.150
<i>They've never seen him that angry before?</i>

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:40.160
<i>Come to think of it, a ring out victory isn't something any ordinary person could do.</i>

00:17:42.030 --> 00:17:45.160
<i>I'll have to remember not to make him angry as well.</i>

00:17:45.160 --> 00:17:46.420
The ring out?

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:48.050
Yeah, that was intentional.

00:17:48.050 --> 00:17:50.680
I saw that punk, Hawk, hanging out with those chicks...

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:55.170
It was pretty satisfying when they freaked out and ran away.

00:17:56.350 --> 00:17:57.690
It was intentional?

00:17:57.690 --> 00:17:59.180
That's incredible!

00:18:01.790 --> 00:18:03.350
Make some room, would you?

00:18:04.030 --> 00:18:06.570
Looks like I've got a guest...

00:18:06.570 --> 00:18:07.640
A guest?

00:18:17.840 --> 00:18:19.520
Bryan Hawk!

00:18:20.360 --> 00:18:21.730
It's Hawk!

00:18:21.730 --> 00:18:23.610
What's the champion doing here?

00:18:23.610 --> 00:18:25.370
Someone get an interpreter!

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:26.760
What brings you to Japan?

00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:28.430
Were you scouting out your opponent?

00:18:28.430 --> 00:18:30.120
Any comments on the fight in December?

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:31.850
Any regarding today's match?

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:34.640
Let's see...

00:18:35.220 --> 00:18:38.390
"First, I'd like to shake hands with Takamura."

00:18:38.980 --> 00:18:43.390
"His power and bravery were both spectacular."

00:18:45.130 --> 00:18:46.640
"I don't believe...

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:51.470
today was a true glimpse of his strength, so it won't be much use."

00:18:51.470 --> 00:18:54.690
"When he fights me, I believe he'll be in much better condition."

00:18:55.020 --> 00:18:56.650
So he gets it!

00:18:56.650 --> 00:19:00.160
Okay, a handshake sounds good to me.

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:02.650
Putting aside his attitude at the match,

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:04.410
he doesn't seem like a bad guy.

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:06.160
It's just lip service...

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:16.440
What is it? What'd he say?

00:19:16.440 --> 00:19:18.170
Something bad about Takamura?

00:19:18.750 --> 00:19:20.370
U-Uh...

00:19:20.830 --> 00:19:22.680
This is a little...

00:19:23.060 --> 00:19:24.520
Don't hide it!

00:19:24.520 --> 00:19:26.690
Just come out with it!

00:19:27.340 --> 00:19:34.190
H-He says, "I came to Japan because I wanted to partake of some of its famous delicacies."

00:19:34.870 --> 00:19:38.730
<i>It wasn't to watch Takamura-san's match?</i>

00:19:38.730 --> 00:19:41.220
So the champion likes Japanese food?

00:19:41.220 --> 00:19:43.700
Anything in particular?

00:19:44.440 --> 00:19:46.200
If you like sashimi,

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:48.910
I know a guy with a boat that can get you plenty!

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:51.120
Or maybe some ramen or gyoza?

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:55.210
If you don't mind it being made by a guy who plays with himself all the time, I'll show you a tasty place!

00:19:56.730 --> 00:19:58.500
I guess ramen is Chinese food!

00:19:59.750 --> 00:20:02.720
Are you sure you want me to?

00:20:03.160 --> 00:20:05.060
No problem.

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:09.130
H-He says...

00:20:09.620 --> 00:20:11.220
"By delicacies,

00:20:11.950 --> 00:20:14.140
I meant Asian women."

00:20:14.620 --> 00:20:17.230
"I hear Japanese women are particularly tasty."

00:20:29.650 --> 00:20:32.550
Come on, Takamura. Where's my handshake?

00:20:32.550 --> 00:20:35.190
Let's shake hands!
